  "text_pages": [
    "Library | Student Life | Campus Life  - CHUNG-ANG UNIVERSITY\nGo Menu\nGo Contents\nGo Footer\nCAU | CHUNG-ANG UNIVERSITY\nMenu\nGo Search\nSearch\n검색\nMost Popular Queries\nclose\nLanguage Select\nKorean\nChinese\n공유\nFaceBook\nKakao Story\ntwitter\nURL Copy\nCAU챗봇\nIntroduction\nAbout CAU\nIntroduction\n3depth\n글자 확대축소 영역\n축소\n원래대로\n확대\nPrint\nShare\nFaceBook\nKakao Story\ntwitter\nURL Copy\nSeoul Campus(as of April 1, 2012)\nEstablished on September 1, 1949, the Central Library at Seoul (about 11,570 m²) houses 1,000,000 books and 4,000 different domestic and overseas periodicals. It features a variety of facilities, such as 2,000-seat study halls, online-information rooms, and audio-visual centers. Online search for current information from home and abroad has been made possible through the KINITI-IR Information Service System installed in 1985 and the computerized CALIS (Chung-Ang Library Information System) initiated on September 19, 1995.\nOpening Hours\nBy room\nSection\nDay\nOpening Hours\nDuring semester\nDuring vacation\nDuring exam. period\nMaterials room\nReference materials room\nLending materials room\nMedia room\nWeekday\n09:00 - 21:00\n09:00 - 17:00\n09:00 - 21:00\nSaturday\n09:00 - 15:00\n09:00 - 15:00\n09:00 - 17:00\nReading room\nReading room 1\nNotebook reading room 1\n1st fl.\nOpen throughout the year\n05:00 - 23:00\n24 hrs\nReading room 2\nNotebook reading room 2\n24 hrs\nReading room for national exams 1,2\n24 hrs\nReading room 3\nReading room 4\nReading room 5\nNotebook reading room 3\n4th fl.\n05:00 - 23:00\n24 hrs\nGraduate school reading room 1, 2\nNotebook reading room(for graduate school)\nThe opening hours of the media room for an exam. period is same to that for a semester.\nClick! Seoul Campus Central Library\nAnseong Campus (As of April 1, 2012)\nEstablished in March 1980, the pyramid-shaped Central Library at Anseong (about 17,024 m²) has a seating capacity of approximately 2,400 and houses about 300,000 books and 3,000 academic journals. Since 1985, the library has offered state-of-the-art information systems such as Dialog, CDP, and KINITI-IR. Thanks to the computerized data management system established in October 1995, online Web search of academic materials from home and abroad as well as of Seoul Campus Library data is available.\nOpening Hours\nSection\nDay\nOpening Hours\nsemester\nvacation\nexam. Period\nMaterials room\nReferences Room\n2F\nWeekdays\n09:10 - 20:00\n09:10 - 17:00\n09:10 - 20:00\nSaturday\n09:00 - 15:00\nClosed\n09:00 - 15:00\nRentable Materials Room\n3F\nWeekdays\n09:10 - 20:00\n09:10 - 17:00\n09:10 - 20:00\nSaturday\n09:00 - 15:00\nClosed\n09:00 - 15:00\nMedia Room\n4F\nWeekdays\n09:10 - 17:00\nSaturday\nClosed\nReading Rooms\nReading Room 1 (A)\nPersonal Reading Room (A)\n5F\nThe Year Around\n06:00 - 23:00\nClosed\n24hours\nReading Room 2 (A)\n1F\n06:00 - 23:00\nReading Room 3 (A)\nB1F\n24hours\nEach Reading Room (B)\nFlexibly Open\nClosed\nOthers\nE-References Room\nInfo Search Room\n2F\nWeekdays\n09:10 - 20:00\nClosed\n09:10 - 20:00\nSaturday\nClosed\nClick! Anseong Campus Central Library\n위로\nQuick Link\nColleges\nclose\nLibraries\nSeoul Campus\nDaVinci Campus\nRelated Site\nstudy in Korea\nCollege\nHumanities\nSocial Sciences\nEducation\nNatural Sciences\nBiotechnology\nEngineering\nICT Engineering\nBusiness & Economics\nMedicine\nPharmacy\nNursing\nArt\nSport Sciences\nSoftware\nArt & Technology\nVirtual Convergence\n사이트맵\nAbout CAU\nWelcome\nPresident's Message\nPresident's Profile\nIntroduction\nIntroduction\nSymbols\nUniversity Identity\nCAU2030\nHistory\nHistory\nPresidents\nOrganization Chart\nMaps and Directions\nDirections\nCampus Shuttle Bus\nCampus Map\nVR Campus Tour\nAcademics\nAcademic Calendar\nUndergraduate School\nHumanities\nSocial Sciences\nEducation\nNatural Sciences\nBiotechnology\nEngineering\nICT Engineering\nSoftware\nBusiness & Economics\nMedicine\nPharmacy\nNursing\nArt\nArt & Technology\nSport Sciences\nGeneral Education\nVirtual C